{"id":"nikak","lemma":"никак","pos":"adv","rank":538,"glosses":["by no means, not at all, in no way, nowise","it appears, it seems, it looks like"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/46/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"\"Вопросы есть?\" - \"Никак нет!\"","en":"\"Do you have any questions?\" \"No, sir.\"","words":[{"g":"question","l":"вопрос"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null,{"g":"no / there isn't"}]},{"text":"Я никак не могу этого знать.","en":"I have no way of knowing that.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…"}]},{"text":"Тебе никак меня не остановить.","en":"There's nothing you can do to stop me.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to stop"}]},{"text":"Ты никак не помог?","en":"Didn't you do anything to help?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to help","l":"помочь"}]},{"text":"Оставаться здесь никак нельзя.","en":"Staying here isn't an option.","words":[{"g":"to remain, to stay"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"it is impossible"}]}]}